// Generated from the output of a local Go program that runs azidentity
// v1.15.0 (MSAL Go v1.10.1) credentials at an ADFS authority, with
// tenants azidentity and MSAL resolve differently, against a fake
// transport with invented hosts; do not edit. Each request is its
// method and URL, its headers (lower case, sorted; client-request-id's
// UUID masked; MSAL's x-client-* telemetry headers dropped) and its
// body, a client assertion in it as <jwt> and decoded on an `A` line:
// its header and claims (Go's json.Marshal, keys sorted; the
// certificate's SHA-1 and SHA-256 thumbprints, the jti and the times
// masked) and whether its signature verifies with the certificate's
// key under its alg. Then each result.

